  <p id="c-jinshu-053-sima-shang:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-053-sima-shang:p001:m0000" ref="zv9_0zr_eyr">尚</persName>字<persName id="c-jinshu-053-sima-shang:p001:m0002" ref="zv9_0zr_eyr">敬仁</persName>。永康元年四月，封為襄陽王。永寧元年八月，立為皇太孫。太安元年三月癸卯，薨，帝服齊衰期，諡曰沖太孫。</p>
